 over tampering.","published":"2026-11-24T20:05:21.000+00:00","url":"https://www.espn.com/college-football/story/_/id/50585093/ncaa-sanctions-liberty-transfer-portal-tampering","type":"HeadlineNews","byline":"Max Olson","source":"ESPN"},{"headline":"Five-star OT Lincoln Fa'alafi commits to Notre Dame, to join 2028 class","description":"New Zealand native Lincoln Fa'alafi, ESPN's No. 8 overall prospect in the 2028 cycle, committed Tuesday to Notre Dame.","published":"2026-11-24T19:56:07.000+00:00","url":"https://www.espn.com/college-football/story/_/id/50584881/notre-dame-gets-2028-commitment-ot-lincoln-faalafi","type":"HeadlineNews","byline":"Eli Lederman","source":"ESPN"},{"headline":"A timeline of Michigan athletics since 2017","description":"Warde Manuel's eventful decade in Ann Arbor has been marked by athletic successes and marred by controversy.","published":"2026-11-24T18:47:39.000+00:00","url":"https://www.espn.com/college-football/story/_/id/49351177/2026-michigan-warde-manuel-athletic-department-tenure-line-investigation","type":"Story","byline":"Paolo Uggetti","source":"ESPN"},{"headline":"What are the conference title game clinching scenarios in Week 13?","description":"Plenty of spots are still up for grabs entering the final week of the regular season.","published":"2026-11-24T18:22:10.000+00:00","url":"https://www.espn.com/college-football/story/_/id/50583399/conference-title-game-clinching-scenarios-week-13","type":"Story","byline":"ESPN","source":"ESPN"},{"headline":"Trev Alberts told he won't be Michigan AD after agreement","description":"Trev Alberts was \"shocked and disheartened\" to be informed by the search firm representing Michigan that he will not be the Wolverines' next AD, he told ESPN.","published":"2026-11-24T23:50:56.000+00:00","url":"https://www.espn.com/college-football/story/_/id/50583155/attorney-trev-alberts-told-next-ad-michigan","type":"HeadlineNews","byline":"Pete Thamel and Dan Wetzel","source":"ESPN"}],"links":{"espn":"https://www.espn.com/college-football/player/_/id/5138455/jide-abasiri","wikipedia":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Jide_Abasiri"},"wiki":{"rules":4,"title":"Jide Abasiri","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Jide_Abasiri","description":"American football player (born 2006)","touched":"2026-11-14T07:38:11Z","intro":"Jide Abasiri (born March 10, 2006) is an American college football defensive tackle for the USC Trojans.","sections":[{"key":"early","title":"Early life","text":"Abasiri attended Prior Lake High School in Savage, Minnesota. As a senior in 2023, he was named the team's defensive lineman of the year and The Minnesota Star Tribune All-Metro First Team after recording 57 tackles and two sacks. He played in the Minnesota High School All-Star Game. He originally committed to play college football at the University of Minnesota before flipping his commitment to the University of Southern California (USC)."},{"key":"college","title":"College career","text":"Abasiri played in 10 games as a true freshman at USC in 2024, recording seven tackles. As a sophomore in 2025, he started nine of 13 games and had 26 tackles and 3.5 sacks. Abasiri returned to USC as a starter his junior year in 2026."}]}}